---
import CarbonLayout from "../../layouts/CarbonLayout.astro";
import AOSInit from "../../components/AOSInit.astro";
import { getRelatedPosts } from "../../data/blogPosts.js";
import NewsletterPopup from "../../components/NewsletterPopup.astro";

export const prerender = true;

// For an Innovation post, mix in Patient Guide and Cost posts
const relatedPostSlugs = [
  "understanding-mri-results",
  "mri-basics",
  "price-transparency-healthcare",
];

// Get the full post data automatically from blogPosts.js
const relatedArticles = getRelatedPosts(
  "future-ai-medical-imaging",
  relatedPostSlugs
);
---

<CarbonLayout
  title="The Future of AI in Medical Imaging: How Artificial Intelligence is Revolutionizing Diagnosis | USRad"
  description="Discover how artificial intelligence is transforming medical imaging with faster, more accurate diagnoses. Learn what AI means for patients and the future of radiology."
>
  <AOSInit />

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 via-white to-blue-50/30 pt-24 pb-16 overflow-hidden"
  >
    <!-- Subtle background pattern -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40">
      <div
        class="absolute top-20 right-20 w-72 h-72 bg-cyan-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-blob"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute top-40 left-20 w-72 h-72 bg-blue-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-blob animation-delay-2000"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="mb-8" data-aos="fade-up">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-[#003087] transition">Blog</a>
          </li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-400">/</span></li>
          <li class="text-gray-900 font-medium">
            The Future of AI in Medical Imaging
          </li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <!-- Title Section -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-6"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path d="M13 7H7v6h6V7z"></path>
            <path
              fill-rule="evenodd"
              d="M7 2a1 1 0 012 0v1h2V2a1 1 0 112 0v1h2a2 2 0 012 2v2h1a1 1 0 110 2h-1v2h1a1 1 0 110 2h-1v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2v1a1 1 0 11-2 0v-1H9v1a1 1 0 11-2 0v-1H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2H2a1 1 0 110-2h1V9H2a1 1 0 010-2h1V5a2 2 0 012-2h2V2zM5 5h10v10H5V5z"
              clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
          </svg>
          Innovation • Medical Technology
        </div>

        <h1
          class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-tight"
        >
          The Future of AI in Medical Imaging
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          How artificial intelligence is improving diagnostic accuracy, reducing
          costs, and revolutionizing patient care—while keeping radiologists at
          the center of medicine.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <article class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Key Takeaway Banner -->
      <div
        class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 text-white"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">🚀 The AI Revolution is Here</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-cyan-50">
          Artificial intelligence isn't replacing radiologists—it's making them
          better, faster, and more accurate. AI is detecting cancers earlier,
          reducing false positives, and making medical imaging more accessible
          and affordable. Here's what you need to know.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats Section -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div
          class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200 text-center"
        >
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-2">94%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Accuracy in cancer detection</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Matching expert radiologists</p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-blue-200 text-center"
        >
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">50%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Faster diagnosis times</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">With AI assistance</p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-purple-200 text-center"
        >
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2">30%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Reduction in false positives</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Fewer unnecessary biopsies</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Featured Image Section -->
      <div class="mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-100 to-blue-100 aspect-video flex items-center justify-center"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/blog/two-rads-control-center.webp"
            alt="AI analyzing medical scans on computer screens"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/30 to-transparent"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center mt-3 italic">
          AI algorithms analyze millions of medical images to detect patterns
          invisible to the human eye
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Introduction -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Imagine a technology that can review your MRI in seconds, spot a tiny
          tumor a human might miss, and predict your risk of disease before
          symptoms appear. That's not science fiction—<strong
            >it's happening right now</strong
          > with artificial intelligence in medical imaging. This revolution is making
          diagnosis faster, more accurate, and more accessible than ever before.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 1: What is AI in Medical Imaging? -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >1</span
          >
          What is AI in Medical Imaging?
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            AI in medical imaging uses <strong
              >machine learning algorithms</strong
            >—computer programs that learn from millions of medical scans—to
            assist radiologists in detecting, diagnosing, and predicting
            diseases.
          </p>

          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-blue-200"
          >
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              How AI "Learns" to Read Medical Images
            </h3>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
                >
                  1
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Training Phase</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                    AI analyzes millions of labeled medical images (e.g., "this
                    scan shows a tumor" vs "this scan is normal")
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
                >
                  2
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Pattern Recognition</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                    The algorithm learns to identify patterns, shapes,
                    densities, and textures associated with diseases
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
                >
                  3
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Validation</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                    AI is tested on new images it hasn't seen before to measure
                    accuracy
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
                >
                  4
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Clinical Deployment</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                    Once validated, AI assists radiologists in real-time
                    diagnosis
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
                >
                  5
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">
                    Continuous Improvement
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                    AI gets better over time as it processes more scans and
                    receives feedback
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">
              💡 Think of AI as a "Second Set of Eyes"
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              AI doesn't replace radiologists—it works <strong>alongside</strong
              > them. The radiologist remains in control, making the final diagnosis.
              AI simply flags areas of concern and helps catch things that might
              be missed.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 2: Current Applications -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >2</span
          >
          AI in Action: Current Applications
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            AI is already being used in hospitals and imaging centers worldwide.
            Here are the most impactful applications today:
          </p>

          <!-- Breast Cancer Detection -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border-2 border-pink-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-pink-400 transition"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
              >
                🎗️
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                  Breast Cancer Detection (Mammography)
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-pink-700 font-semibold">
                  Most mature AI application
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm">
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>What AI does:</strong> Analyzes mammograms to detect early
                signs of breast cancer, including tiny calcifications and subtle
                masses.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-pink-50 rounded-lg p-4">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Proven Results:</p>
                <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-700">
                  <li>
                    • 13% increase in cancer detection rate (Swedish study,
                    2023)
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    • 20% reduction in false positives (fewer unnecessary
                    callbacks)
                  </li>
                  <li>• 50% reduction in radiologist workload for screening</li>
                  <li>
                    • FDA-approved systems from Transpara, iCAD, and others
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-green-100 border-l-2 border-green-500 pl-3 py-2">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-700">
                  <strong>Patient Impact:</strong> Earlier detection means more treatment
                  options and better survival rates.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Lung Cancer Screening -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border-2 border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-blue-400 transition"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
              >
                🫁
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                  Lung Cancer Screening (CT Scans)
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-blue-700 font-semibold">
                  Finding nodules missed by human eyes
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
              <p>
                <strong>What AI does:</strong> Identifies and measures lung nodules
                (small growths) that could be early-stage cancer.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-4">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Key Benefits:</p>
                <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-700">
                  <li>• Detects nodules as small as 3mm</li>
                  <li>• Tracks growth over time automatically</li>
                  <li>• Reduces false positives by 30%</li>
                  <li>• Prioritizes high-risk cases for urgent review</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Stroke Detection -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border-2 border-red-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-400 transition"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
              >
                🧠
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                  Stroke Detection (Brain CT/MRI)
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-red-700 font-semibold">
                  Every minute counts in stroke care
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
              <p>
                <strong>What AI does:</strong> Instantly detects signs of stroke
                on brain scans and alerts the stroke team.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">
                  Life-Saving Speed:
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-700">
                  <li>• Analysis in under 60 seconds</li>
                  <li>• Automatic alerts to stroke team</li>
                  <li>• 30-minute reduction in time-to-treatment</li>
                  <li>• Better outcomes and reduced disability</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div
                class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-2 border-yellow-500 pl-3 py-2 mt-3"
              >
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-700">
                  <strong>Critical Fact:</strong> In stroke, "time is brain." Faster
                  detection = more brain tissue saved.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Additional Applications Grid -->
          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200"
          >
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              Other AI Applications in Imaging
            </h3>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">
                  🦴 Fracture Detection
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  X-rays analyzed for subtle fractures, especially in ER
                  settings
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">
                  💓 Cardiac Analysis
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  Measuring heart function, detecting coronary artery disease
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">
                  👁️ Diabetic Retinopathy
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  Eye scans showing diabetes-related damage
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">
                  🫀 Abdominal Imaging
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  Liver disease, kidney stones, pancreatic abnormalities
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">
                  🦷 Dental Imaging
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  Cavity detection, bone loss, root canal needs
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">
                  📊 Osteoporosis Screening
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  Bone density analysis from routine CT scans
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 3: Benefits for Patients -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >3</span
          >
          What AI Means for You: Patient Benefits
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            AI in medical imaging isn't just cool technology—it directly
            improves your healthcare experience:
          </p>

          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <!-- Benefit 1 -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <span class="text-3xl">✅</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">
                  Earlier Detection
                </h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                AI spots diseases at earlier, more treatable stages—often before
                symptoms appear. Early detection dramatically improves survival
                rates for cancers and other serious conditions.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 2 -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-blue-200"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <span class="text-3xl">⚡</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Faster Results</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                AI can analyze your scan in seconds, helping radiologists
                provide reports faster. This means less waiting and quicker
                treatment decisions—especially critical in emergencies.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 3 -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-purple-200"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <span class="text-3xl">🎯</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">
                  More Accurate Diagnosis
                </h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                AI reduces human error and fatigue. When radiologists work with
                AI, diagnostic accuracy improves by up to 15%—meaning fewer
                missed findings and fewer false alarms.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 4 -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-orange-200"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <span class="text-3xl">😌</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">
                  Fewer False Positives
                </h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                AI helps distinguish between benign (harmless) and suspicious
                findings, reducing unnecessary callbacks, biopsies, and the
                anxiety that comes with them.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 5 -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-pink-200"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <span class="text-3xl">💰</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Lower Costs</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                AI increases efficiency, reducing the time radiologists spend on
                routine screening. This can lower imaging costs over time,
                making healthcare more affordable.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 6 -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-teal-200"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <span class="text-3xl">🌍</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Better Access</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                AI can assist in areas with radiologist shortages, enabling
                teleradiology and bringing expert-level analysis to rural or
                underserved communities.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 4: Emerging Technologies -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >4</span
          >
          The Near Future: What's Coming Next
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            The next 3-5 years will bring even more revolutionary AI
            capabilities to medical imaging:
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <!-- Predictive AI -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-indigo-300"
            >
              <h3
                class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"
              >
                <span class="text-2xl">🔮</span>
                Predictive AI: Disease Before Symptoms
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-3">
                <strong>The future:</strong> AI analyzing subtle patterns in your
                scans to predict diseases <em>before they develop</em>.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg p-4">
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-sm">
                  Examples in Development:
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-700">
                  <li>• Predicting Alzheimer's 6+ years before symptoms</li>
                  <li>
                    • Identifying heart attack risk from routine chest X-rays
                  </li>
                  <li>• Detecting early signs of diabetes from eye scans</li>
                  <li>• Forecasting osteoporosis progression</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Personalized Treatment -->
            <div
