            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700 ml-4">
              <li>
                • AI can't understand context (medical history, symptoms, other
                tests)
              </li>
              <li>• AI can't communicate with patients or other doctors</li>
              <li>
                • AI can't handle rare or unusual cases outside its training
              </li>
              <li>
                • Medical liability requires a licensed physician's oversight
              </li>
              <li>
                • Human judgment is irreplaceable for complex decision-making
              </li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-3 mt-3">
