              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mb-2">
                <strong>The Solution:</strong>
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-700 ml-4">
                <li>
                  • Diverse training datasets including all ethnicities, ages,
                  and body types
                </li>
                <li>
                  • Regular audits for fairness and accuracy across populations
                </li>
                <li>
                  • FDA requirements for demographic performance reporting
                </li>
                <li>• Ongoing research to eliminate bias</li>
